msgid "K Aphorisms"
msgstr "Aforismos de KDE"

#: main.cpp:35
msgid ""
"K Aphorisms\n"
"\n"
"A program to display aphorisms each day, week, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Currently the 'Anthroposophischer Seelenkalender' (Calendar\n"
"of the Soul) is provided.\n"
"Other contributions are welcome."
msgstr ""
"Aforismos de KDE\n"
"\n"
"Un programa para mostrar aforismos cada dia, semana, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Na actualidade prové-se co \"Calendário da Alma\".\n"
"Agradecen-se as colaborazóns."

